       ],\n        \"value\": \"肺癌（主要为非小细胞肺癌 NSCLC，小细胞肺癌 SCLC 数据缺失）患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗时的肠道和口腔/呼吸道微生物组。研究范围涵盖微生物组成、多样性、功能代谢物、临床混杂因素（抗生素、PPI）以及作为预测生物标志物的潜力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cb10a6832f9807d6009cd8c5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"这是一篇叙事性综述，旨在综合评估微生物组作为肺癌免疫治疗疗效和毒性预测生物标志物的证据。文章系统梳理了肠道和口腔微生物组在 ICI 治疗中的角色，重点分析了特定菌属（如 Akkermansia muciniphila）、微生物多样性及代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸、肌苷）与无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）的关联。同时，综述讨论了抗生素和质子泵抑制剂（PPI）对微生物组的破坏作用及其对预后的负面影响，并探讨了从单一物种标记向复合评分模型转变的趋势，以及粪菌移植（FMT）等干预策略的早期临床数据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bb97eec65a48d4b515580494\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"证据多为观察性关联，因果推断受限；口腔微生物组的阳性结果仅限于特定治疗组合（放化疗+免疫），不可外推至所有 ICI 场景；SCLC 数据缺失。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物组特征（高 alpha 多样性、特定有益菌）与 ICI 疗效（PFS/OS 改善）的正向关联证据，以及抗生素/PPI 暴露与疗效下降的负向关联证据。同时指出口腔微生物组在 ICI 单药治疗中预测价值有限，但在联合治疗中可能有信号。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::57ee940b9154bb8ebec71f77\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"许多机制细节源自黑色素瘤或胰腺癌的临床前模型，在 NSCLC 中的直接临床验证不足；部分代谢物（如 SCFAs）的作用具有双重性或情境依赖性（如 butyrate 在黑色素瘤中可能有害，在肺癌中未直接评估）。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了介导机制：微生物代谢物（SCFAs, inosine, Uro A）通过调节树突状细胞成熟、CD8+ T 细胞priming、TME 重塑及 gut-lung axis 通讯来增强抗肿瘤免疫。同时也提到了潜在的负面机制（如某些 SCFAs 增加 Tregs，LPS 促进 IL-6）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::faa138d638b4ef961b6eb3c4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述指出当前研究存在严重的异质性（测序平台、采样时间、生信流程），且多数研究未调整抗生素/PPI 等关键混杂因素。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1fd06e0624ce56a056b016c7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提及 FMT-LUMINate 试验等早期阶段 FMT 干预数据，显示在 PD-L1 高表达 NSCLC 患者中取得高客观缓解率。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::acb1f02292f978c4fafc718b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述主要聚焦于 NSCLC，SCLC 的证据几乎空白，结论不能直接推广到小细胞肺癌。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6310df1ab85c47992b704566\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"口腔微生物组的预测价值具有高度的治疗情境依赖性（仅在联合治疗中可能有效），不能泛化为所有免疫治疗的通用标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e334203f3b602dbb33f589fa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"所引用的机制多来自其他肿瘤类型的临床前模型，在肺癌中的直接适用性需谨慎对待，作者已明确指出这一点。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3e99ed01c95e2c5a4011ad60\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"抗生素和 PPI 的影响是间接证据，综述未区分其对肠道和口腔微生物组的具体独立贡献。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::110a10deaf00848d9f26dfb3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0566\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ba084eb01ffbfae5b25958c7\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5198686663715b4d988b29f0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f031ab1a69ff8b4e0e17ba3c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0e0fa36df6dd0fc2c9cfed13\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文采用叙述性综述与观点阐述相结合的方法。作者基于现有文献（引用12篇近期研究），从理论框架出发，梳理微生物组作为生物标志物和靶点的逻辑链条；通过分类讨论（疾病风险、治疗应用、肿瘤学）归纳微生物组在不同临床场景下的作用机制与应用现状；最后系统性地列出技术、伦理和基础设施层面的挑战，并提出未来发展方向。未涉及新的实验数据收集或统计分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::332802380144a43c6d4a885a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了微生物组在精准医学中应用的系统性全景图，特别是明确了其在肿瘤免疫治疗响应预测中的潜在角色及具体挑战。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为观点/评论文章，未提供原始实证数据；对具体机制的描述多为概括性陈述，缺乏针对特定固体瘤类型的详细分子通路分析；未提供具体的临床验证结果或统计显著性证据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f9fe92e0bea3d4a62b063515\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"肠道菌群失调（Dysbiosis）\",\n          \"finding\": \"可预测结直肠癌、炎症性肠病（IBD）、2型糖尿病、神经退行性疾病（帕金森、阿尔茨海默症）及肥胖等疾病的发病风险，早于临床症状出现。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::47fbbea83020b0d9819eba26\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"药物代谢与免疫治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物组影响药物代谢（如左旋多巴在帕金森病中的代谢）及免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）在癌症治疗中的疗效和毒性反应。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::da43992d96c01ea2a92d6d67\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"临床转化障碍\",\n          \"finding\": \"个体间和时间上的高度变异性、采样与分析方法不一致、因果关系难以确立、纵向数据缺乏、监管框架不完善以及人群代表性偏差是主要限制因素。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3822fe691559dca026c2a8f3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"perspective\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bb9cf892c940f97762694aaf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管微生物组在精准医学中展现出巨大潜力，但当前面临的主要障碍是什么？如何将微生物组数据有效整合到临床决策中以实现真正的个性化预防、诊断和治疗？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d06066d95fe2d4cf0ab6fadd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"人类微生物组（Human Microbiome）在精准医学（Precision Medicine）中的应用前景，涵盖疾病风险分层、治疗应用及肿瘤学领域。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5b931bcf0e389024f9c17af\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇编辑引言/观点文章，旨在探讨人类微生物组如何作为精准医学的新前沿重塑疾病病理学理解及个性化医疗策略。文章指出微生物组不仅是健康的被动反映者，更是代谢、免疫和药物反应等关键功能的动态参与者。作者综述了微生物组在早期诊断生物标志物开发、药代动力学影响（Pharmacomicrobiomics）、以及通过粪菌移植（FMT）或定制益生菌进行干预方面的潜力，同时分析了将其整合到临床实践中面临的标准化、因果推断、数据隐私及监管挑战，并展望了多组学联合与人工智能驱动的未来方向。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5b59140d7e2229eee427ca6e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅陈述关联性，未提供具体菌株或代谢物如何调节T细胞功能或肿瘤微环境的具体机制细节；未限定于特定类型的固体瘤，需结合其他实证研究细化。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"确认了肠道微生物组组成与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效及毒性的关联，指出微生物特征可用于预测预后和指导治疗策略。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d000b902024313e63163e159\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"本文本身未阐明具体机制路径，仅作为问题提出的来源；其提到的机制多为一般性描述，缺乏针对固体瘤微环境的特异性解释。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了微生物组通过代谢产物（促进或抑制肿瘤生长）和影响免疫反应来参与疾病进程的假设性机制框架；指出了因果推断困难是当前知识瓶颈。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fbbe94d3915a0a2a24ca21c8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"微生物组作为个性化签名（Personalized Signature），受遗传、年龄、饮食、地理等因素影响；微生物组-宿主互作网络。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::42e720e8ac52c1a97ded02de\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"标准化难题、因果推断困境、纵向数据缺失、监管与伦理问题。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4104ad6c0144d63a09e922a3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是观点/评论文章，非实证研究，其声称的关联（如微生物组与ICI疗效）需由后续实证论文验证，不可将此处的陈述视为已证实的结论。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c670656ba85216475975b742\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的‘固体瘤’相关内容较为宽泛，未区分具体癌种（如黑色素瘤、肺癌等），在提取机制时需警惕过度泛化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ad10144c31957b028bc15924\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作者强调因果推断困难，因此在利用本文素材时，应明确标注其为‘提出潜在联系’而非‘证明机制’。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f684c0e6dd0e8ac3f6de764b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0031\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"pdf\",\n              \"reason\": \"full-page text extracted; page positions retained\",\n              \"status\": \"fitz\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"fitz\",\n              \"reason\": \"layout, table relations, formulas, figure pixels, and scanned text may be lost\",\n              \"status\": \"known_gap\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::685224e9339ec834861ba17f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::588f1a1bd6f3ca1ef607f35e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6fed13ee3e0c7ddd385f0f64\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cd73c0f181b0330ab3328ee1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用系统性文献回顾与综合叙述的方法。作者按逻辑顺序组织材料：从肠道黏膜屏障（先天免疫）入手，逐步分析对髓系细胞（巨噬细胞、树突状细胞）和淋巴系细胞（ILCs、T细胞）的影响；接着聚焦于特定微生物代谢物（SCFAs、肌苷、TMAO、色氨酸、胆汁酸）介导的抗肿瘤免疫反应；最后综述结合ICIs的微生物群治疗策略（FMT、益生菌、益生元、饮食）及其在预防irAEs中的应用。文中引用了大量临床观察性研究、队列研究和动物模型实验证据进行综合论述。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::639d3b1baaee912770ba34f1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物群调节癌症免疫治疗的多层次机制框架，涵盖了从黏膜屏障到全身免疫细胞（髓系和淋巴系）的广泛互作网络。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，其结论依赖于引用的原始研究，部分机制主要基于动物模型或小型观察性研究，缺乏大规模随机对照试验的直接因果证据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6ca66daecb12bd49acdd5815\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统梳理了五种主要微生物代谢物（SCFAs, Inosine, TMAO, Tryptophan derivatives, Bile acids）在免疫调节中的具体作用路径。\",\n          \"limits\": \"不同研究中代谢物的测量方法、样本类型（粪便vs血浆）及癌症类型各异，导致直接比较存在困难；部分关联仅为相关性，尚未完全确立因果关系。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::947c49ed771b71df32520851\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"评估了FMT、益生菌、益生元和饮食干预等临床转化策略的现状，指出了标准化和定植效率等关键挑战。\",\n          \"limits\": \"目前大多数临床试验处于早期阶段（Phase I/II），样本量小，且FMT供体选择、给药方案和长期安全性尚未标准化，难以形成统一的临床指南。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::86aadbb229018afa8c76e39c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"指出了当前研究的空白，如微生物特征是否具有泛癌种普适性、SCFAs的双向作用矛盾、治疗期间微生物动态变化的预测价值等。\",\n          \"limits\": \"这些未解问题本身即为局限性的体现，表明该领域仍处于探索阶段，许多假设仍需未来多组学研究和大型前瞻性队列验证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::184db8501301ec4d0502dee4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"转移性黑色素瘤患者接受伊匹木单抗治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"基线肠道微生物群富含Faecalibacterium和其他厚壁菌门的患者比富含拟杆菌的患者具有更长的无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::879a32130d48905cf03cb52c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"胰腺导管腺癌（PDAC）小鼠模型及临床观察\",\n          \"finding\": \"乳酸杆菌产生的TMAO促进巨噬细胞向M1型极化，增强效应T细胞反应并提高ICI疗效；而高表达AhR的巨噬细胞与PDAC患者较差的免疫治疗反应相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6915227a4c4ed95c31ceef17\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"晚期胃肠道癌症患者接受抗PD-1/PD-L1治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"粪便中较高浓度的乙酸、丙酸、丁酸和戊酸（SCFAs）以及与PD-1抑制剂疗效显著延长PFS相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f1356dfb86975218fe960216\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"三阴性乳腺癌临床观察队列（n=360）\",\n          \"finding\": \"由梭菌目细菌产生的TMAO通过触发癌细胞焦亡增强CD8+ T细胞驱动的抗肿瘤免疫反应，从而提高免疫治疗疗效。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::30b095e52ad9dd495a39b64d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"接受PD-1阻断治疗的结直肠癌患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"具核梭杆菌（Fusobacterium nucleatum）抑制抗肿瘤T细胞介导的适应性免疫；而Akkermansia muciniphila的补充可重新建立PD-1阻断的疗效。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::afc8e779e61ff2cdf0207616\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"接受PD-1抑制剂治疗的胃癌患者队列\",\n          \"finding\": \"既往抗生素暴露（pATB）与显著降低的PFS和OS相关，客观缓解率（ORR）和疾病控制率（DCR）在非pATB组显著更高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7b657e933f0cabb151e5b80a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::59169f7db2f838b92912b609\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"旨在澄清肠道微生物群与抗肿瘤免疫反应之间的机制关系，解释为何不同患者对免疫治疗的反应存在差异，并探讨如何利用微生物群作为预测性生物标志物和辅助治疗手段以优化癌症免疫治疗 outcomes。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d41c291461a2e726d93e8cdd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"肠道微生物群与癌症免疫治疗（特别是免疫检查点抑制剂，ICIs）疗效及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）之间的关系。涵盖多种实体瘤（如黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、结直肠癌、肝细胞癌等），涉及宿主-微生物双向互作、微生物代谢物介导的免疫调节机制以及基于微生物群的临床干预策略。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d4370aa1a51c8a09881791ed\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，系统阐述了肠道微生物群如何通过复杂的生物双向相互作用调节癌症免疫和免疫治疗结果。文章首先介绍了肠道作为最大免疫器官的背景，随后详细分析了微生物群通过模式识别受体信号传导和表观遗传调控影响先天免疫（如巨噬细胞、树突状细胞）、适应性免疫（T细胞、NK细胞）及固有淋巴细胞的机制。重点讨论了短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）、肌苷、氧化三甲胺（TMAO）、色氨酸衍生物和胆汁酸等关键微生物代谢物在驱动免疫细胞分化和活性中的作用。此外，综述评估了粪菌移植（FMT）、益生菌、益生元和饮食干预等治疗策略在增强ICI疗效和管理irAEs方面的潜力与挑战，并指出了当前研究在标准化、定植效率及因果机制验证方面的局限性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d52c609c9103892c8aaaec0c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些关联多为观察性研究结果，存在癌症类型特异性（如黑色素瘤 vs 肺癌 vs 肠癌），且受混杂因素（如饮食、合并用药）影响，不能直接推断因果。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物群组成与实体瘤ICI疗效关联的临床证据汇总。例如，指出富集Faecalibacterium、Akkermansia muciniphila与改善PFS/OS相关，而Bacteroides富集或与较差预后相关。同时列出了抗生素暴露（pATB）与生存期缩短的关联。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0f5d7d096251017b490735bf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"部分机制主要在动物模型中证实（如小鼠FMT实验），人类临床数据的直接验证有限；某些代谢物的作用具有情境依赖性（如SCFAs在某些情况下可能抑制T细胞 trafficking）。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了微生物群调节ICI疗效的具体分子和细胞机制。包括：1) SCFAs通过HDAC抑制和GPCR信号影响Treg分化和巨噬细胞功能；2) TMAO通过焦亡增强CD8+ T细胞活性；3) 色氨酸代谢物（如IAC）通过AhR/IDO1通路调节Treg/CD8+ T平衡；4) 胆汁酸通过NKT细胞积累影响肝脏肿瘤免疫；5) 微生物抗原通过DCs激活T细胞。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7844395ad2d0985d2f12fb18\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"多数干预措施处于早期临床试验阶段，缺乏大规模III期RCT证据；FMT的定植效率和长期安全性仍是主要障碍；益生菌产品的标准化和质量控制问题突出。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"总结了基于微生物群的干预策略（FMT, 益生菌, 益生元, 饮食）在增强ICI疗效方面的临床前和早期临床研究结果。例如，FMT使部分ICI耐药黑色素瘤患者获得PR/CR；特定益生菌（如L. casei + L. reuteri）在PDAC模型中增强ICI疗效。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1e79e4b409e44183c62bb807\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"irAEs的微生物机制仍在研究中，保护性菌群的作用主要在动物模型中得到验证，人类临床应用的规范尚不明确。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"解释了微生物群如何影响免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。指出irAEs的发生与特定菌群失调（如Bacteroides intestinalis增加，有益菌减少）相关，并提到FMT可用于治疗难治性ICI诱导的结肠炎。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::daf05ebcac9a4ccc4ba5b7d8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"引言部分关于GI tract免疫功能的描述，以及微生物群通过循环代谢物影响全身免疫的概念。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ed2e668db070b35892b903f4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Discussion部分的“Unresolved issues and contradictory findings”。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::45517040011b84cb6fbcf265\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Translational challenges部分。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c3e678fb3ea2081e63b354fd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述涵盖多种实体瘤，但不同癌症类型中微生物群的作用可能截然不同（如Akkermansia在NSCLC/RCC中有益，但在其他癌症中不一致），使用时需注意癌症类型的特异性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d2360beb5d7ef22710f37801\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的许多机制证据来自小鼠模型，直接外推到人类需谨慎，尤其是涉及复杂的人体免疫系统和微生物群落结构时。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::50359ff5e38cdcbacfb28b5a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"临床观察性研究中的关联不等于因果，特别是对于代谢物水平与疗效的关系，可能存在反向因果或混杂因素（如饮食、药物）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4615d5edd36a172156421c14\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"FMT和益生菌的效果在不同研究中差异巨大，部分源于产品标准化不足和患者基线状态差异，不能一概而论地认为所有微生物干预都有效。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c28946c806a4057bba9aea36\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"抗生素暴露对ICI疗效的负面影响在多队列中得到一致报道，但具体影响的微生物机制仍需进一步阐明。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b72a761761b778df736e9e8f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0433\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::f2a7f6253e7390084ec754fd\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ff98946ce345f3fbc8f0ccdf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9cb0bfe96806bac2fcc1e5c0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::38095d2723cf3006b98ba9f7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作为一篇理论性综述，本研究未进行新的实验数据采集，而是采用文献综合与逻辑推演的方法。首先回顾肿瘤新抗原的定义、免疫原性及在ICI治疗中的必要性；其次，分析当前预测ICI响应的临床标志物（如TMB、PD-L1表达）的局限性；接着，整合关于微生物组（特别是肠道菌群）影响ICI疗效的临床前和临床研究证据；最后，基于“分子模拟”概念，提出微生物肽段与肿瘤新抗原序列相似性的假设，并详细设计了两套研究方案（小鼠模型构建与人类临床队列生物信息学分析）以验证该假说。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4aaa25b309ffca2f07cb6edb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统性地提出了“微生物肿瘤新抗原模拟”作为解释微生物组调节ICI疗效的新机制框架；提供了具体的实验设计路线图（包括动物模型构建和人类临床样本的生物信息学分析指标“肿瘤抗原相似性”TAS）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的原创性实验数据来直接证实该模拟机制在人类患者中的因果效应；目前主要依赖间接证据（如抗生素/益生菌干预的结果）和理论推导；净效应（促进还是抑制免疫）尚不明确，且存在个体差异和情境依赖性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::62ec9168dbd857721493d326\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基于现有临床前模型（如无菌小鼠、抗生素处理小鼠）和部分临床观察\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物组的组成和功能状态显著影响ICI的治疗效果。例如，补充特定细菌（如双歧杆菌、拟杆菌属）可增强ICI疗效，而抗生素使用则削弱疗效。粪菌移植（FMT）从 responder 患者转移到受体可恢复疗效。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2d0b9cab1bcfd2d5a6d831f7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基于免疫学和生物信息学理论推导\",\n          \"finding\": \"人体微生物组拥有巨大的遗传多样性，统计上极有可能存在与人类肿瘤新抗原具有相同或高度相似氨基酸序列的微生物肽段。这些微生物来源的表位可能激活交叉反应的T细胞克隆，从而间接增强抗肿瘤免疫。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::47bb8afbfa1b6138466bb146\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基于胰腺癌长期生存者的数据引用\",\n          \"finding\": \"在胰腺癌长期生存者中发现了针对肿瘤新抗原的T细胞克隆，这些克隆表现出对微生物表位的预测交叉反应性，支持了分子模拟在体内实际发生的观点。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c4a4cab39ade76a97f52aa7e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4947a9c714bd762ac8bdfb56\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在许多实体瘤中取得了显著疗效，但仍有大量患者无法受益或出现耐药。除了已知的肿瘤突变负荷（TMB）和T细胞浸润等标志物外，肠道微生物组被证明能调节ICI疗效，但其具体分子机制尚不明确。本文试图回答：微生物产生的肽段是否通过模拟肿瘤新抗原来调节抗肿瘤免疫？这种模拟对ICI治疗的响应性和结果有何具体影响？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::26a10265049ec4edc7625d04\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"癌症免疫治疗（特别是免疫检查点抑制剂，ICIs）中的肿瘤新抗原及其与微生物组的关系；聚焦于肠道和肿瘤局部微生物产生的肽段对肿瘤新抗原的分子模拟现象。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::315ed5797bc100d811c58dc3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述文章，旨在阐述肿瘤新抗原在癌症免疫治疗中的核心作用，并重点探讨由肠道及额外肠道微生物物种通过自然基因表达程序产生的、与肿瘤新抗原相似的表位（即分子模拟）如何影响宿主抗肿瘤免疫反应。文章指出，这种微生物介导的新抗原模拟可能是解释为何部分患者对免疫检查点阻断疗法产生长期有利反应而其他患者无反应的关键机制之一。文章梳理了现有证据，提出了该假说的生物学基础，并设计了未来验证这一机制的实验策略。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::52fe348fdea7a925c6ecc268\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这是理论假说，尚未在大规模临床试验中得到确证。净效应（是促进还是诱导耐受）尚不清楚。不能直接用于预测单个患者的具体响应，除非结合具体的TAS计算。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了微生物组调节ICI疗效的潜在机制假说：微生物肽段通过模拟肿瘤新抗原，激活交叉反应的T细胞，从而增强抗肿瘤免疫。文中指出，高微生物多样性增加模拟概率，与更好的ICI响应相关；抗生素减少多样性，降低模拟，导致疗效下降。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ebf5b60d36bc65fe74b98c5f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"序列相似性不等于免疫原性。文中承认并非所有模拟肽段都能达到足够的浓度或被呈递。HLA I类分子的丢失（LOH）可能干扰这一过程，需作为混杂因素考虑。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了分子模拟的生物学基础：微生物基因组庞大，存在与人类新抗原序列相同或相似的肽段。提出了两种可能的模拟形式：完全相同的序列和仅核心区域相似的序列。还提到了微生物代谢物（如短链脂肪酸、肌苷）的辅助调节作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::094396a7ab8220ce967708a4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这是一种建议的研究策略，而非已完成的实证结果。需要高质量的测序数据和复杂的生物信息学流程支持。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了评估微生物-肿瘤模拟程度的具体生物信息学方法：通过全外显子组测序（WES）和RNA-seq鉴定肿瘤新抗原，通过宏基因组测序鉴定微生物抗原序列，计算“肿瘤抗原相似性”（TAS），并将TAS与临床结局关联。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2cd8117d46ec4a60724bb265\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文章强调了肿瘤新抗原是ICI起效的必要条件，并指出当前标志物（TMB, PD-L1）的局限性。同时介绍了微生物组在ICI疗效中的已知作用（抗生素负面、FMT正面）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::58cc3c80cdb229fa4d6c103a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文章提到微生物代谢物（短链脂肪酸、肌苷）也可能调节免疫，与分子模拟假说并列。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bc01aa160f430d2b4cf044d0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文章建议通过补充益生菌、增加微生物多样性或工程化改造共生菌来增强模拟效应，从而提高ICI响应率。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::82835fe9e0946c17b0f34bc7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该论文是综述而非原始研究，其提出的“分子模拟”机制目前仍属于假说阶段，缺乏直接的人类因果证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7bf0c966467032c358c89729\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中引用的证据多为间接的（如抗生素/FMT干预结果），不能直接等同于证明了分子模拟的存在。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c4020d03213a1f5ad272386f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"“肿瘤抗原相似性”（TAS）是作者提出的概念，尚未成为临床常规检测指标。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::462e05446d3fceff7fc1f05f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"微生物组的影响具有高度的情境依赖性（如肿瘤类型、宿主免疫状态），不同研究间可能存在异质性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e71d76c4b6bc7a8bf3767be0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"HLA I类分子丢失（LOH）可能削弱或消除由模拟肽段引发的T细胞反应，这是一个重要的负面调节因素。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::941743b13cac1bbd7e0ea15f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0561\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ca394ec40bbe18e5f5985500\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8347d53db17c421f0cbebd65\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::336117ada34774b108edf279\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::24203a85bfdc072771ead098\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用单中心回顾性队列设计。纳入标准：确诊晚期黑色素瘤或NSCLC，接受指定TKI（达非替尼、维莫非尼、吉非替尼、阿法替尼、厄洛替尼）一线治疗。暴露定义：在TKI开始前2周至开始后6周内使用任何抗生素（ABX+组）vs. 该期间未使用抗生素（ABX-组）。主要终点：PFS和OS，依据RECIST v1.1标准评估。统计分析：首先进行单变量Cox比例风险模型分析筛选显著因素，随后构建多变量Cox模型以调整年龄、ECOG体能状态（PS）、LDH水平、脑转移等协变量，评估ABX使用的独立预后价值。探索性分析包括ABX累积使用次数及ABX与PS的交互作用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e06f4e0000a449162427f3a7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了早期证据，表明在常规临床实践中，抗生素使用是接受TKI治疗的晚期黑色素瘤和NSCLC患者不良预后的独立预测因子。\",\n          \"limits\": \"研究为回顾性观察性设计，无法确立因果关系；样本量较小（仅55例ABX使用者），限制了按抗生素类别细分分析的效力；未能控制感染本身对预后的潜在影响；所涵盖的TKI药物组合（如单药达非替尼/维莫非尼）已非当前晚期黑色素瘤的标准治疗（现常联合MEK抑制剂），结果的外推性受限。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ec6cf0223e6e7a02047edcc2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"全队列（n=168），多变量调整后\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗生素使用与缩短的PFS [HR 1.71, 95% CI 1.15-2.54, P=0.008] 和 OS [HR 2.24, 95% CI 1.47-3.39, P<0.0001] 独立相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::92b8554a4f885a0a07562584\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"体能状态较差亚组（ECOG PS ≥2）\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗生素使用对OS的负面影响尤为显著，HR高达3.82 (95% CI 1.18-12.36, P=0.025)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ededc437b42ac178b3e63302\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"不同抗生素使用模式\",\n          \"finding\": \"单次使用与累积多次使用抗生素相比，未显示出显著不同的有害效应差异；累积使用并未证明有“安全阈值”。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a806a9055ca026973db26dda\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d9a739d182bc58a1b3426790\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"抗生素的使用是否会影响接受酪氨酸激酶抑制剂（TKI）治疗的晚期黑色素瘤和NSCLC患者的生存结局？其影响方向及强度如何？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ec4c4cafe0181188fe78f47f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"回顾性队列研究，对象为2015年1月至2017年4月在英国The Christie NHS Foundation Trust接受一线酪氨酸激酶抑制剂（TKI）治疗的晚期黑色素瘤和非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c39e506871ab6013a37ad0b2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨抗生素（ABX）使用对接受靶向治疗（TKI）的晚期实体瘤患者疗效的影响。鉴于既往研究显示抗生素通过破坏肠道菌群可能降低免疫检查点抑制剂和化疗的疗效，但其在TKI治疗中的作用尚不明确，作者利用回顾性临床数据，比较了在使用TKI前后特定时间窗内使用抗生素与未使用抗生素患者的无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）。研究纳入了168名可评估患者，通过多变量分析调整混杂因素后，发现抗生素使用与较短的PFS和OS独立相关，且这种负面影响在体能状态较差的患者中更为显著。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::aeee672c4cf1dba74b44a631\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"该研究针对的是TKI，不能直接外推至所有类型的免疫治疗或新型靶向药物；且为观察性关联，非机制性解释。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"证实了在非免疫治疗（TKI）情境下，抗生素使用依然与较差的临床结局（PFS/OS）相关，支持了抗生素广泛抑制抗癌疗效的观点。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d51f96398e0f18e8e77b25aa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"作者明确指出未进行粪便微生物分析，因此这些机制仅为基于文献的推测和药理学合理性假设，并非本研究的实证发现。感染本身的免疫抑制效应未被排除。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了抗生素影响TKI疗效的可能机制假说，包括肠道菌群多样性丧失、全身炎症反应改变以及潜在的药代动力学相互作用（如CYP3A4酶诱导/抑制）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a893735614a9bfd81a1677c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"TKI治疗中ABX使用导致PFS和OS缩短的多变量分析结果，特别是HR值和时间窗定义。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e8e9cbbb736eed2d2a18b979\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究中关于ABX与ECOG PS交互作用的发现，以及作者承认未探索感染原因的限制。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f93b25ce515311a0a0c8e807\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"讨论部分提到的大环内酯类抗生素对CYP3A4的抑制作用可能影响TKI代谢。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::db66f853b09ab5461710be4b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究结论仅限于回顾性观察到的关联，不可解读为抗生素必然导致TKI失效的因果证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1b81170d45711b784e1fc3aa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为2015-2017年的患者，使用的黑色素瘤治疗方案（单药BRAF抑制剂）已过时，结果可能不适用于当前的双药联合疗法（BRAF+MEK抑制剂）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dce1fe918e0af1515735f452\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究中ABX使用者的样本量较小（n=55），且未按抗生素种类进行分层分析，因此无法判断特定类别抗生素的影响差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::758d496721e15630dea05a21\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"未能区分抗生素使用是因为预防性措施还是治疗活动性感染，后者本身可能就是预后不良的标志。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a5281619a9dadfc2cf297edd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0012\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-edcd953058d1d5fa5081\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-eb9c2f9558e012b438e7\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::75e6dfc7ae3a6e8eb5967591\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0070263b30459eccccb2c8c3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1fe7abb276fe0af1c83c1c10\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6d4dcfbcfa788578fcc324d1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用叙述性综述方法。作者检索并筛选了关于肠道微生物组与ICIs疗效关系的已发表文献，分为“临床前研究”和“临床研究”两部分进行归纳。在临床前部分，按免疫治疗类型（抗CTLA-4、抗PD-L1、抗PD-1）整理动物实验中的微生物干预措施（如抗生素处理、粪便移植、单菌定植）及其对肿瘤生长和免疫表型的影响。在临床研究部分，按基线微生物多样性、抗生素使用影响、免疫介导的结肠炎以及代谢特征等主题汇总人类患者数据。最后，通过对比两类研究的异同，讨论免疫调节机制、转化挑战及未来标准化需求。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2048f488b617a9941ce34256\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了截至2019年关于肠道微生物组与ICIs疗效关系的全面文献总结，建立了包含临床前和临床发现的系统分类框架。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为一篇叙述性综述，其结论依赖于所纳入研究的原始质量，且由于各研究间设计、人群和技术平台的差异，无法提供统一的定量效应估计。文中明确指出当前数据存在不一致性，尚未确立标准化的微生物生物标志物。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3c3b6661d01e420b1c6293d1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"临床前模型（小鼠）\",\n          \"finding\": \"共生肠道菌群对于ICIs的抗肿瘤活性至关重要。抗生素清除或无菌环境会削弱疗效；特定细菌（如Bacteroides spp.、Akkermansia muciniphila、Bifidobacterium spp.）的补充可恢复或增强对PD-1/PD-L1/CTLA-4阻断的反应，涉及增加CD8+ T细胞浸润、促进树突状细胞成熟及诱导Th1型免疫反应。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dbc0101da3ccadc1272bcb82\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"临床研究（黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者通常表现出更高的肠道微生物α多样性，且富集特定菌属（如Faecalibacterium、Clostridiales目、Ruminococcaceae科、Akkermansia muciniphila）。相反，非响应者中Bacteroidales目、Escherichia coli等丰度较高。抗生素使用在某些研究中与较差的PFS/OS相关，但在其他研究中无显著影响，显示结果不一致。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8c928549ce5370fc33a0db5b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"机制探讨\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物可能通过抗原模拟、提供共刺激信号或直接代谢产物影响免疫系统。具体机制包括增强DCs的抗原呈递能力、促进记忆T细胞从淋巴结向肿瘤微环境（TME）迁移、减少调节性T细胞（Tregs）和髓系衍生抑制细胞（MDSCs）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::92d8a6983e5f875ef67f29cb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df3118577f22ec33a98f4663\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管肠道微生物组被认为可能影响免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效，但目前的临床前和临床研究结果存在不一致性，且其作为预测性生物标志物的临床效用尚不明确。本研究旨在解决如何整合现有证据以理解微生物组的作用，并识别阻碍其转化为可靠生物标志物的关键障碍。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a2a62233a277d1362a8ccff8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述聚焦于肠道微生物组（gut microbiome）与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括PD-1、PD-L1和CTLA-4抑制剂）抗肿瘤疗效之间的关系。研究范围涵盖了临床前（小鼠模型）和临床研究两个层面，旨在梳理现有的证据基础、潜在的免疫调节机制以及当前研究中存在的不一致性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::63945f6ef57088b1a632725a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇系统性综述，旨在评估肠道微生物组作为预测免疫检查点抑制剂疗效生物标志物的潜力。作者综合了已发表的临床前研究和临床研究结果，详细列举了与ICIs疗效正相关或负相关的特定细菌物种及分类群。文章不仅总结了微生物组影响抗肿瘤免疫反应的潜在机制（如树突状细胞成熟、T细胞浸润等），还深入探讨了临床前与临床研究之间发现的不一致性问题，分析了导致这些差异的可能原因（如宿主-微生物生态系统的复杂性、采样与分析方法的标准化不足等），并提出了未来建立可靠生物标志物所需的研究方向和方法学改进建议。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e3d16a2075982ff7167de376\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些关联主要基于观察性研究和小型队列，因果关系未完全确立。不同研究间的定义标准（如OTU聚类算法）不同，直接比较丰度数值需谨慎。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了具体的微生物-疗效关联列表：正面关联包括Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium spp., Faecalibacterium genus, Ruminococcaceae family, Clostridiales order等；负面关联包括Bacteroidales order (含Bacteroides spp.), Escherichia coli, Roseburia intestinalis等。同时指出了不同研究中结果的矛盾之处（如Bacteroidetes在某些研究中与响应相关，在其他中与不响应相关）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d3542d1a49feb8f802f06372\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"许多机制细节来自小鼠模型（如B. fragilis诱导Th1反应），在人体中的直接验证有限。综述指出具体细菌种类与特定免疫通路的精确对应关系仍不完全清楚，需警惕将动物模型机制直接外推至人类。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"阐述了微生物影响ICIs疗效的潜在生物学机制：1) 增强树突状细胞（DCs）成熟和抗原呈递；2) 促进CD4+和CD8+ T细胞（特别是记忆T细胞和效应T细胞）向肿瘤微环境的募集和活化；3) 调节Treg和MDSC的比例；4) 通过代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸等，虽提及但未详述具体分子）影响免疫状态。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::17da5e4bc3b5aa34f96ea596\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述讨论了采样方法（粪便vs盲肠内容物）、测序技术（16S rRNA vs 宏基因组鸟枪法）、数据分析流程以及混杂因素（饮食、抗生素、地理位置）对结果一致性的影响。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ab7cd056b8a8f9e73a8a6530\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提到了正在进行的临床试验（Table 3），涉及粪便微生物移植（FMT）、益生菌/益生元联合治疗等策略。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c56379e4e6e58b401d0143eb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"讨论了肠道微生物组与免疫介导的结肠炎（immune-mediated colitis）的关系，如Firmicutes门富集与ipilimumab诱导的结肠炎风险增加相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9f5db9130e896bccddcbe99a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述发表于2019年，后续可能有大量新研究出现，需注意时效性限制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::30a8980c13b3672ea88d08e4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"综述中引用的临床前和临床研究之间存在明显的异质性，不能简单地将所有阳性结果合并为一个统一的“有益微生物”列表，必须保留其情境依赖性（如肿瘤类型、ICI药物类型）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bb2e061a8745a6ec51f716ef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"对于“抗生素使用”的影响，综述本身也指出了相互矛盾的证据，因此在引用时应明确区分不同研究的结论，避免一概而论。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d7d25ce2adf86513b9ea7b91\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制描述多基于作者对现有文献的综合推断，部分机制（如特定细菌与特定T细胞亚群的直接因果联系）在人类中尚待更严格的实验验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b50e56c3bbd31c7a7385298e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0171\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-57c86dec56d8ae37b5be\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-cf2fc9e893310420ac34\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3caed5dcaa83845654da0e2f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7d353bc4bd873e32582c670f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::09b4e0a1ba12760e2fb8442f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::87fbbb61dc2c0edaa5061341\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作为一篇综述，本文采用主题综合的方法，而非系统性的文献检索流程。作者选取了五个具有代表性的研究领域（癌症免疫治疗、食品乳化剂、IBD患者队列、可溶性纤维补充、人群血糖反应），分别阐述其中微生物群如何影响干预效果。通过对比不同研究中关于特定细菌与临床结局关联的异质性，以及展示微生物群介导的饮食效应（如乳化剂诱导的炎症、纤维诱导的肝癌或缓解结肠炎），构建“抗性/易感”概念框架，进而评估个性化干预的现状与前景。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6e9e45e9a3ffa6a4e686f161\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了“抗性”与“易感”微生物群的概念框架，强调个体间微生物群差异是解释饮食和药物干预结果异质性的关键因素。\",\n          \"limits\": \"文章未提供新的实验数据，而是对现有文献的综合评述；对于如何标准化定义“抗性”和“易感”状态，以及具体的临床实施路径，尚缺乏统一标准。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::14cff54e09e9534717ce9940\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"指出了当前微生物群研究在方法学上的局限，如测序平台和分析工作流的不统一，以及物种水平分析的不足，呼吁向宏基因组和宏转录组层面发展。\",\n          \"limits\": \"未能详细比较不同测序技术的具体优劣，也未提供具体的技术操作指南。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::db7920471cda288170f1db00\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"强调了非微生物因素（如性别、遗传、昼夜节律）对微生物群及干预效果的潜在影响，为未来研究提供了多维度的视角。\",\n          \"limits\": \"对这些因素如何具体交互作用的机制探讨较为简略，主要作为未来研究方向提出。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::de133c33149b49c1c784eb79\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"癌症免疫治疗（抗PD-1疗法）\",\n          \"finding\": \"肠道微生物群组成可预测免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效；响应者中Faecalibacterium属丰度较高，非响应者中Bacteroidales目丰度较高；Akkermansia muciniphila的丰度与临床反应相关，且补充该菌可恢复小鼠模型中的治疗 efficacy。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cf7780ad4ecf33898bebec6b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"饮食乳化剂（CMC和P80）摄入\",\n          \"finding\": \"乳化剂改变微生物群组成，促进微生物侵入粘液层，引发低度肠道炎症和代谢紊乱；这种有害效应依赖于复杂的微生物群，且在缺乏微生物群的无菌小鼠中不出现。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f9f1ee51c96cee6ae31e3533\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"麦芽糊精摄入与克罗恩病（CD）\",\n          \"finding\": \"麦芽糊精增强CD相关粘附侵袭性大肠杆菌（AIEC）的生物膜形成；由于仅30%-40%的CD患者携带AIEC，针对全人群的无麦芽糊精饮食试验可能因混杂了AIEC阴性个体而显示无效，但在AIEC阳性亚组中可能有效。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a28cf92576eebd223952fef6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"可溶性纤维（菊粉）补充\",\n          \"finding\": \"在野生型小鼠中有益，但在IL10KO基因易感小鼠中加剧结肠炎；在雄性小鼠中导致肝细胞癌（HCC），且该效应由微生物群介导，可通过抑制微生物发酵预防。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2660117baf2722ea13854afd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"餐后血糖反应（人群研究）\",\n          \"finding\": \"相同饮食引起的餐后血糖反应存在高度个体差异；整合微生物群组成的机器学习算法能准确预测个体的血糖反应，支持基于微生物群的个性化饮食推荐。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fc9ea9de3c5e6fed92bf1f31\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d98313016ef4abf0fb2ba063\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"在慢性炎症性疾病管理中，基于肠道微生物群组成的个性化饮食干预是否已经成熟到可以应用于临床？其科学依据、现有证据及面临的障碍是什么？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::775e297de80479c8f6a3e278\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"慢性炎症性疾病（包括炎症性肠病、结直肠癌、代谢综合征等）与肠道微生物群之间的相互作用，重点探讨基于微生物群组成的个性化饮食干预的可行性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e9df2c6b2f020f9468f10f72\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在回答“我们是否准备好使用基于肠道微生物群组成的个性化饮食干预来治疗慢性炎症性疾病？”这一问题。文章首先概述了非遗传因素（如饮食成分）对肠道微生物群及宿主炎症的影响，随后通过癌症免疫治疗、乳化剂研究、患者队列研究、可溶性纤维研究以及人群基础研究的案例，论证了个体间微生物群差异对干预结果的决定性作用。作者指出，尽管目前已有证据表明微生物群可以预测药物疗效和饮食反应，但由于细菌物种关联的不一致性、检测方法的局限性以及机制的复杂性，完全个性化的临床实施仍面临挑战。文章建议将粪便采样纳入常规临床试验，并探索更精细的微生物分析手段以识别“抗性”和“易感”个体。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7239e636c35d0ccf8dfdf308\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些发现来自黑色素瘤研究，且不同研究间存在细菌物种关联的不一致性，需谨慎外推至其他实体瘤类型。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了癌症免疫治疗中微生物群预测疗效的直接证据：Gopalakrishnan等发现响应者富集Faecalibacterium，非响应者富集Bacteroidales；Routy等发现Akkermansia muciniphila与响应相关，且补充该菌可恢复疗效。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2603601f994fa56e8980351a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"文章未深入阐述具体的分子机制，仅指出微生物群的中心作用，具体通路需参考其他专门研究机制的论文。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提示了微生物群可能通过影响宿主免疫状态或药物代谢来调节疗效的机制线索：例如Akkermiasia muciniphila的补充恢复了PD-1阻断的疗效，暗示微生物群可能通过调节局部或全身免疫环境发挥作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7433488fa448a7e804425140\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这是从饮食干预研究中推导出的方法论建议，并非直接针对ICIs试验的设计规范。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了关于临床试验设计的重要启示：由于个体间微生物群差异巨大，基于群体的平均结果可能掩盖亚组的显著疗效，因此需要考虑基于微生物群的 stratification。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7bf6b8989f1a421ea3102de3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这属于对领域现状的评论，而非具体的机制发现。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"指出了当前机制研究的局限性：不同研究报道的与疗效相关的细菌物种存在差异，这可能反映了技术平台、分析流程或患者人群异质性的影响，而非单一的因果机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fbaa0ef7abb83c3ce43bb95b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文章开篇总结了肠道微生物群在慢性炎症性疾病中的角色，以及饮食作为核心影响因素的背景。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0b547d2fdf7e2a50155284e3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提出了“抗性”与“易感”微生物群的概念，并图示说明不同个体对同一干预（如乳化剂、膳食纤维）的不同反应。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c93c2f2f360978f7c92c35be\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文章指出目前大多数研究依赖16S rRNA测序，可能不足以准确预测反应，需要宏基因组或宏转录组分析，甚至菌株水平的鉴定。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5bd50b5bc6be59c5dd2ec247\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提到了FMT在复发性艰难梭菌感染中的成功应用，以及在IBD中的探索性应用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f699ad0c5b4c2d633ece8cd7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文主要聚焦于饮食干预，其对ICIs疗效的讨论主要集中在癌症免疫治疗领域，且多为观察性关联，需谨慎推断因果关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3690087e9bf834aa5c74a070\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文章中提到的细菌物种（如Faecalibacterium, Akkermiasia）在不同研究中的关联可能存在冲突，不能简单视为普适性标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f4f82da340149475a0e7b6fc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文章未提供具体的ICIs临床试验数据，其关于个性化干预的建议是基于逻辑推导和跨领域类比，而非直接的ICIs证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6d9c0219637b872c2715ad88\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0375\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::726335ccc8dcc022aa10d9c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9ec8d6abd7d45ecb2afdff8e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c0469283aef12ec7b089ec63\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::22c2a86826ff5178286311d1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Retrospective cohort study. Patients receiving ICIs for advanced/metastatic disease between Jan 2018 and Dec 2023 were grouped based on infusion timing relative to the median time of all treatments ('early group': <50% cycles after median time; 'late group': ≥50%). Primary endpoint was OS. Multivariable-adjusted Hazard Ratios (HRs) were estimated using standard Cox models and time-dependent Cox models to account for potential changes in group assignment over time. Sensitivity analyses were performed.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3411659c8a5c411b2e7aba87\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides evidence from a large sample size suggesting a benefit in OS with early ICI administration, utilizing time-dependent Cox models to reduce immortal time bias.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Retrospective design limits causal inference; results may be specific to the single-centre setting; no difference found when chemotherapy is included; sensitivity analysis results varied by model type.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::86be55c0fd1c481f08135111\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Overall cohort (n=2631)\",\n          \"finding\": \"Median OS was significantly shorter in the late group (13.1 months) compared to the early group (21.4 months). Time-dependent Cox model showed HR 1.30 (95% CI 1.16-1.44) for death in the late group.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1c462fad1719cdc8697afb2a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Regimens with ICIs alone (n=1886) or ICIs plus tyrosine kinase inhibitors (n=163)\",\n          \"finding\": \"The association between later administration and shorter OS remained significant.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::83d0fdb0fb696690c582b8f6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Regimens comprising chemotherapy (n=582)\",\n          \"finding\": \"No significant difference in OS was observed between early and late groups.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7c00aacbe807f3ae64142343\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Sensitivity analysis based on exposure at 3 months\",\n          \"finding\": \"Standard model showed no difference (HR 1.09, 95% CI 0.98-1.20); time-dependent model showed higher risk of death for late group (HR 1.14, 95% CI 1.02-1.26).\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b0fc8533710744ce6605ea36\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3deb489d5cb67e2529f53c32\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"To determine if the time of day of ICI infusion affects treatment response and overall survival in patients with advanced solid tumours, addressing limitations of previous small-scale studies with methodological biases.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b9f8df840eb553c32c248e70\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Advanced solid tumours (lung cancer, melanoma, renal carcinoma, head and neck, urothelial cancer) treated with immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) at a large tertiary cancer centre; retrospective cohort analysis.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8f8d3bef8a6d1205a4fe9cb4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This study investigates whether the timing of ICI administration influences overall survival (OS), based on evidence of circadian dependence in the immune system. Using a large single-centre cohort of 2631 patients, the authors compared outcomes between 'early' and 'late' treatment groups, defined by whether ≥50% of cycles were administered after the median infusion time. The analysis employed Cox models with and without time-dependent variables to mitigate immortal time bias, adjusting for age, sex, ECOG status, cancer type, and treatment regimen.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1270b9c8a5eee9f889b793cf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"Does not address microbiome mechanisms directly. Results are associative, not causal. The lack of effect in chemo-combined regimens suggests interaction with other drug classes, which complicates direct comparison to microbiome studies that might focus on different regimen types.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides observational data on how non-microbial factors (administration timing) correlate with ICI efficacy in solid tumours. Specifically, it shows that earlier administration is associated with better OS in ICI-only and ICI+TKI regimens, but not in chemo-combined regimens.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8f7c3d6374184de4f9ebc6fc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The mechanism is proposed based on general immune system circadian dependence, not specifically linked to gut microbiota in this study. It does not provide evidence for microbiome-mediated mechanisms.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Offers a mechanistic hypothesis (circadian dependence of the immune system) as an alternative or complementary explanation for ICI efficacy variation.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::264c6709cc910d12ebd5a8dc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Findings on the impact of infusion timing on OS across different cancer types and regimen combinations.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1c2fc03bd228d69f90700d6f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Use of time-dependent Cox models to address immortal time bias.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::efb551cb64f4a996542cfcde\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The study is retrospective and single-centre, limiting generalizability.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cc9ac9200723c62e3332eec1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Associations do not imply causation; unmeasured confounders may exist.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a65a67c7fc1223583e7be583\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The 'early' vs 'late' grouping is based on median infusion time, which may not reflect optimal biological timing.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d76e4eb2c50a15b19045343c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Results differ by regimen type (chemo vs non-chemo), so findings cannot be universally applied to all ICI treatments.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::09bde12acd20d48d0d686ba1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Sensitivity analysis yielded mixed results depending on the statistical model used.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::82ade6aaf80d65c3443ed8a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0558\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2f36d454510b1c8d961d57df\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5dfa2f6307bf1552e1a399f9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cbf91a989264a5e9ed236597\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4aee8f5e401934d0c175afb0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用叙述性综述方法，整合来自临床前模型（小鼠模型、类器官）和人类患者队列的研究数据。文章按主题组织：1) 微生物在癌症发生中的作用；2) 微生物调节抗癌药物（化疗、ICI）疗效的机制；3) 微生物生物标志物用于预测疗效；4) 通过干预手段（抗生素、益生菌、FMT、噬菌体、纳米技术）调控微生物群的方法；5) 当前研究的局限性与未来展望。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::95bca79832feaf98a134a7b2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物群调节癌症治疗（特别是ICI和化疗）机制的综合框架，包括代谢降解、免疫调节和生态变化（TIMER框架）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略和筛选标准；作为综述，其结论依赖于引用的原始研究，且许多机制主要基于小鼠模型，存在向人类外推的不确定性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::193438df5e5ac33fd79baef2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"总结了多种微生物调控策略（益生菌、FMT、噬菌体、纳米技术）的临床前和早期临床证据。\",\n          \"limits\": \"指出目前缺乏大规模多中心临床试验验证微生物疗法的长期安全性和有效性；部分临床结果存在冲突（如益生菌试验），归因于个体差异和研究设计局限。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e82b793a7ce02d60b98b6908\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"化疗药物（吉西他滨、环磷酰胺、5-FU等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"特定细菌可代谢药物使其失活（如Gammaproteobacteria代谢吉西他滨导致胰腺癌耐药）；某些共生菌（如Enterococcus hirae, Barnesiella intestinihominis）通过刺激Th17细胞或γδT细胞浸润增强环磷酰胺疗效；具核梭杆菌通过TLR4/MYD88通路激活自噬促进5-FU耐药。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::48d9aafeca596013be0f3518\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"免疫检查点抑制剂（CTLA-4, PD-1/PD-L1）\",\n          \"finding\": \"Bacteroides fragilis和Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron通过诱导淋巴结Th1反应和树突状细胞成熟增强抗CTLA-4疗效；Akkermansia muciniphila富集与非小细胞肺癌和肾细胞癌中对PD-1阻断剂的响应相关；黑色素瘤患者中Faecalibacterium和Ruminococcaceae富集与生存期延长相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dec77698dba2619f48ff3701\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"肿瘤发生与进展\",\n          \"finding\": \"幽门螺杆菌通过β-catenin信号通路促进胃癌；具核梭杆菌通过FadA粘附素结合E-cadherin激活Wnt/NF-kB通路促进结直肠癌；Peptostreptococcus anaerobius通过PI3K-Akt通路促进增殖和炎症。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9511e05d6896aa7fa29e9b9c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"治疗毒性管理\",\n          \"finding\": \"FMT可缓解ICI引起的结肠炎和放疗引起的肠道毒性；Lactobacillus rhamnosus GG通过释放脂磷壁酸（LTA）保护上皮干细胞免受辐射损伤。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::599db5fe66f0c6df0c804397\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bd18c6ef74b443a822a4424f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已有大量关于肠道微生物群影响癌症治疗的证据，但需要综合理解微生物与癌症治疗的具体交互机制，以便识别新的预防策略、对患者进行分层以提高治疗效果并减少并发症。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::27c44bf3d7caa7f1d1f260de\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"肠道微生物群在癌症治疗中的作用，涵盖化疗药物、免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）及放疗的疗效调节、肿瘤发生机制、微生物生物标志物、治疗相关毒性的管理以及通过益生菌、粪菌移植（FMT）、噬菌体和纳米技术进行微生物调控的策略。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3342e506c85d5bbfddf3ee03\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，系统梳理了肠道微生物群与癌症治疗之间的相互作用。文章首先阐述了微生物群失调如何促进肿瘤发生（如幽门螺杆菌、具核梭杆菌等），随后重点讨论了不同细菌物种如何通过代谢药物、调节免疫反应或诱导耐药性来影响化疗和免疫治疗的疗效。此外，综述还评估了利用微生物特征作为诊断/预后标志物的潜力，探讨了通过抗生素、益生菌、FMT和新型纳米技术/噬菌体疗法调控微生物群以增强疗效或减轻毒性的策略，并指出了当前研究在因果机制验证、动物模型外推性及临床转化方面的局限性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d68f1d7be2df847cbd65c8ef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"相关性不等于因果性；不同研究使用的测序方法（16S vs metagenomics）、样本类型（粪便vs组织）和癌症类型可能导致结果偏差；部分发现仅在小鼠模型中验证，人类数据有限。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"列举了与ICI疗效正相关和负相关的特定细菌物种。例如，Bacteroides fragilis、Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron、Akkermansia muciniphila、Faecalibacterium prausnitzii、Ruminococcaceae被报道与ICI响应相关；而某些未明确命名的菌群或缺乏有益菌的状态与无响应相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7de397c7634b39d8bdffe607\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"许多机制细节（如Akkermansia的具体通路）主要基于小鼠模型或体外实验，人类体内的确切机制仍需更多验证；不同细菌的作用可能相互交织，难以孤立分析单一机制。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细描述了微生物调节ICI疗效的机制：1) Bacteroides species诱导淋巴结Th1反应和肿瘤内树突状细胞成熟；2) Akkermansia muciniphila通过IL-12途径促进CCR9+CXCR3+CD4+ T淋巴细胞募集到肿瘤微环境；3) 微生物通过TLR4激活髓系细胞产生TNF等炎症因子，增强免疫监视；4) 微生物代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸SCFAs）可能增强CD8+ T细胞的记忆潜能。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::54bb4fdad7705305ec54b250\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"本题目聚焦ICI，化疗机制可作为背景参考，但不直接回答ICI的特异性机制。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"指出微生物群也影响化疗疗效，如Gammaproteobacteria代谢吉西他滨导致耐药，而某些细菌增强环磷酰胺疗效。这为理解广义的“抗癌治疗”提供了背景。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::556dc29681cb461be8b36faa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述讨论了FMT、益生菌、噬菌体和纳米技术在癌症治疗中的应用潜力及局限性。例如，FMT在缓解ICI结肠炎和放疗毒性中的初步证据，但样本量小、缺乏机制洞察；益生菌临床试验结果不一致，受个体微生物组和宿主基因组影响大；噬菌体和纳米技术尚处于早期阶段。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c0a4b24151e52eb58609dc77\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"提到F. nucleatum在CRC中的诊断价值（结合FIT提高性能），以及与MSI状态、肿瘤位置、预后的关联。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::984b10a4e42684438bc48144\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"指出小鼠模型与人类生理的差异、抗生素使用的混杂效应、饮食和环境因素的影响、以及病毒组和真菌组的潜在作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::91ee4199ed9203bb31c2a3e6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述是2020年发表的，后续可能有新的重大发现，使用时需注意时效性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::054563d2038db64bf6dbf5f8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中提到的许多机制主要基于小鼠模型（germ-free mice, antibiotic-treated mice），在向人类推广时需格外谨慎，因为小鼠和人类的肠道微生物组成及生理存在显著差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::189ee075d443a0a8a4076fde\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"对于益生菌和FMT的效果，文中明确指出临床证据有限且存在冲突，不应将其视为已确立的标准疗法。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::788bf004ee45cd5fa0bb13bd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"不同癌症类型（如CRC vs Melanoma vs NSCLC）中微生物的作用可能截然不同，需区分对待，避免过度泛化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9e22ec4c8c30ff5945d7ac5d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0229\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-30c4d9a86f8c4e63ba33\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-2d4faf2da7bc361a24e6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::821a4b5022eeeb3a92523e6f\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::da470854082ae3519201c93a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0e392f2741b0f93bae38bcf7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eef080ffa6526d7f034bb32e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The study employs a computational modeling approach. It constructs a dynamic model of tumor-immune-gut microbiome interactions. The parameters for gut bacteria dynamics were fitted to clinical data from melanoma patients. Virtual patient data were generated based on clinical survival data. Simulations were then run to analyze the impact of initial bacterial levels and growth rates on therapeutic outcomes, comparing scenarios with manipulated vs. natural bacterial compositions.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::05116375370aabb6ca40490a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides a theoretical model linking gut microbiome dynamics to ICI efficacy, offering mechanistic insights into interpatient heterogeneity.\",\n          \"limits\": \"The findings are derived from simulations and model fitting, not direct experimental validation. The specific mechanisms of interaction are inferred through the model rather than empirically proven. The generalizability beyond melanoma or specific model assumptions is not established in this abstract.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::812a29729d0569843ec91062\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"At the initiation of anti-PD-1 therapy\",\n          \"finding\": \"Low initial growth rate and low level of favorable bacteria predict non-responders, while a high level of favorable bacteria predicts responders.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9f9dc46c0fca85bc8c805b82\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Through simulation of bacterial manipulation\",\n          \"finding\": \"It is possible to promote the response rate to anti-PD-1 by manipulating the gut bacteria composition of non-responders, potentially achieving long-term progression-free survival.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::180cd9e0445370625d26cf5c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"theory\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5b574c8eff2c26db3363b047\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The research investigates why only a subset of patients shows durable clinical responses to ICIs despite their high success in some solid metastatic malignancies. Specifically, it seeks to understand the underlying mechanisms by which favorable and unfavorable gut bacteria modulate anti-PD-1 efficacy and to identify predictive markers for treatment response.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bc2761f49854f8882dead30a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The study focuses on the interaction between the gut microbiome and the efficacy of anti-PD-1 immune checkpoint inhibitors in cancer treatment, specifically using melanoma patient data as a reference for model calibration. The scope is limited to theoretical modeling and simulation rather than clinical trials or wet-lab experiments.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::013530ac89b265b4772bb2e9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This paper addresses the heterogeneity in patient responses to immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) by exploring how the gut microbiome influences therapeutic outcomes. The authors developed a mathematical model to simulate tumor-immune-gut microbiome interactions. They fitted the dynamics of gut bacteria to clinical data from melanoma patients and generated virtual patient datasets based on survival statistics. The study aimed to identify predictive markers for responders versus non-responders and to evaluate whether manipulating gut bacterial composition could improve response rates. The work provides a computational framework to understand mechanisms that are not fully explained by empirical studies alone.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::be73708f468266ddc0678883\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"These are model-derived predictions fitted to clinical data, not independent prospective validations. The causal link is theoretical within the model structure.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Identifies specific microbial characteristics (low/high levels of favorable bacteria, growth rates) as predictive markers for anti-PD-1 response in melanoma patients via modeling.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::91197f30babbd6c32cdd1a19\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The mechanism is simulated; actual biological pathways are not detailed. The claim of achieving long-term progression-free survival is a simulation result, not a clinical observation.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Proposes a mechanism where the initial state of favorable bacteria determines therapeutic outcome, and suggests that modifying this state can shift non-responders to responders.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a8a6a7123af68e7f4e79f93\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"The use of melanoma patient data to calibrate the model and the focus on anti-PD-1 therapy.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d39d3c28cec61e16914b5346\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The results are based on a theoretical model fitted to clinical data, not direct experimental evidence of causality.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b5593bd6e42114fbf96bf247\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The specific findings regarding predictive markers are derived from simulation outputs and may depend on model assumptions.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7245caff3982eb86a32b47d5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The generalizability to other types of solid tumors or different ICI classes is not addressed in the abstract.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::decc20b4febb01d740031b54\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Claims about improving response rates through bacterial manipulation are hypothetical based on simulation, not confirmed clinical outcomes.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::77d026a6cc947cee8b070bee\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0525\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_empty\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b52cf9e1252591b6988e94d5\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ed84bfa0d924f906dce32dbc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eefefea07d6878b3752fb470\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ed99ee349cf7e2108d0c9964\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用纵向队列设计，纳入HIV感染者和健康对照者。在基线（ART前）、治疗后6个月和治疗后12个月三个时间点收集样本。使用全基因组宏基因组测序技术获取微生物数据，结合生物信息学分析方法解析微生物群落结构（分类学组成）并推断其功能（代谢通路）。通过组间比较和时间序列分析来评估ART干预下的动态变化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::546dc499ea44116be66a96fd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了HIV感染者在接受ART治疗前后肠道微生物组和代谢通路变化的纵向数据，证实了ART仅能部分恢复微生物失调。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给材料未交代具体的统计显著性水平、样本量大小、HIV感染者的临床分期/CD4计数等混杂因素控制情况，也未明确说明是否建立了严格的因果关系证据链。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3d287971f46755b7b6042a2b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ART治疗前 vs HIV阴性对照\",\n          \"finding\": \"HIV感染者表现出显著的肠道微生物失调，特征为促炎微生物的富集以及拟杆菌门（Bacteroidetes）比例的降低。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6147fe50b1a75a1346e5d56b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ART治疗后6-12个月\",\n          \"finding\": \"随着ART治疗的进行，变形菌门（Proteobacteria）的比例下降并持续至12个月；拟杆菌门比例先升后降。整体失调未完全逆转。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d80efe1c4773c92faac2b3a1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"代谢通路分析\",\n          \"finding\": \"丙酮酸发酵至异丁醇的代谢通路改变在HIV感染者中持续存在，即使经过12个月的ART治疗仍未恢复。该机制的改变与Ruminococcus bromii物种丰度的降低呈相关性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b3c67d6d0fbaa64a990f0530\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::28ae9179302c3f88f8763f49\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"核心问题是：肠道微生物组的失调是否与HIV疾病进程有因果联系，还是仅仅反映了宿主免疫和代谢系统受疾病影响后的继发改变？同时探究ART治疗对这种失调及代谢通路的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9ca0638881caa3424c4c5fb2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为HIV感染者（PL-HIV）与健康对照者；研究情境涵盖ART治疗前、治疗后6个月及12个月的时间点；范围聚焦于肠道微生物群落的组成变化及其衍生的代谢通路动态。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1beed5cbe59f1132e3562305\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨肠道微生物组在HIV感染及抗逆转录病毒治疗（ART）过程中的作用，特别是区分微生物失调是疾病的原因还是结果。通过全基因组测序和生物信息学分析，比较了HIV阴性人群与接受ART治疗的HIV感染者在治疗前、后6个月及12个月的肠道微生物组成和代谢通路。研究发现，HIV感染者存在显著的微生物失调，表现为促炎微生物富集和特定菌门比例改变。ART治疗虽能部分改善这种失调，但无法完全恢复，且持续影响某些关键代谢通路（如丙酮酸发酵至异丁醇途径），这与Ruminococcus bromii物种的减少相关。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fa45074ac801c19969563333\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"不能直接回答ICI在实体瘤中的疗效问题。HIV与实体瘤的免疫微环境差异巨大，此处的微生物变化不直接等同于ICI响应相关的微生物标志物。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了慢性病毒感染（HIV）状态下肠道微生物组失调的典型特征，包括特定的菌群失衡（如拟杆菌门减少、变形菌门变化）和代谢通路的持续性异常。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b2e7ffae968b86f2dadae989\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"所给材料未详细阐述该代谢通路具体如何影响免疫系统或肿瘤微环境。不能将此机制直接外推至ICI疗效机制，除非有额外的文献支持HIV模型与ICI模型在该代谢路径上的同源性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了微生物代谢通路（异丁醇途径）与特定菌种（R. bromii）之间的关联，暗示了微生物代谢活动可能是介导宿主生理状态改变的重要机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d273cae802639736e13992c1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"论文展示了如何使用全基因组测序和生物信息学分析来追踪微生物组随时间（治疗前后）的动态变化，以及将分类学变化与功能代谢通路联系起来的方法。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5c69ca328d17163eb93f2c01\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"指出ART治疗虽有益但会导致持续的代谢通路改变和部分失调，提示药物治疗可能存在长期的微生物副作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eabdcfe14d06e442a537ec12\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"严格区分HIV感染模型与实体瘤/ICI模型的生物学差异，不可直接将HIV相关的微生物标志物视为ICI疗效预测因子。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d9fc3ff47c5be409e71db45e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"注意“相关性”不等于“因果性”，文中提到的代谢通路改变与菌种减少的相关性需结合其他证据谨慎解读。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ac01dd1b97a2cb47cee04edc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究主要关注代谢通路和菌群组成的变化，对于具体的免疫细胞浸润、细胞因子水平等直接免疫效应指标，所给材料未提供详细信息。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::144bd64b15ea10bc68fd82d0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0024\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"known_losses\": [\n                \"headings/tables/math/image pixels are not preserved by this plain HTML projection\"\n              ],\n              \"reason\": \"body converted to structured material; headings/tables/math/image pixels may be lost\",\n              \"status\": \"derived\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_not_scholarly_body\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_not_scholarly_body\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_challenge_or_login\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"pdf\",\n              \"reason\": \"full-page text extracted; page positions retained\",\n              \"status\": \"fitz\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"fitz\",\n              \"reason\": \"layout, table relations, formulas, figure pixels, and scanned text may be lost\",\n              \"status\": \"known_gap\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::c34b473f98dc1a3df1e0ea42\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c0f45620867bb47d8d241b27\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d95556f59f1a5dfeaf412001\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3e18a3ea80bd35dda72e241a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用基于GWAS摘要数据的两样本双向孟德尔随机化设计。暴露变量包括肠道微生物丰度、微生物代谢通路和血浆代谢物；结局变量为8种特定癌症的风险。使用逆方差加权（IVW）作为主要分析方法，辅以MR-Egger、加权中位数和贝叶斯加权MR进行敏感性分析。通过FDR校正控制假阳性，并利用MVMR调整混杂后计算中介效应比例。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0c44cc68e693e76a84a1056e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物、血浆代谢物与8种常见癌症之间的大规模因果关联证据，特别是揭示了微生物-代谢物-癌症轴的中介机制，为精准医疗提供了潜在的生物标志物和治疗靶点。\",\n          \"limits\": \"1. 样本仅来自欧洲人群，限制了在其他种族中的外推性。2. 由于微生物GWAS统计效力较低，使用了较宽松的SNP阈值（P < 1e-5），尽管进行了严格筛选，但仍可能存在弱工具变量偏差和高假阳性率（部分结果FDR极高）。3. MR假设线性关系，无法捕捉非线性效应；结果反映长期累积效应，难以量化特定时间点的干预效果。4. 许多发现的中介比例较小或统计效力有限，需独立队列验证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1cdc42d4e710b56fbd34e0ac\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"单向MR分析，P_IVW < 0.05且排除不一致方向或显著多效性结果\",\n          \"finding\": \"识别出129种肠道微生物、57条微生物代谢通路和463种血浆代谢物与泛癌存在潜在因果关联。其中15种微生物、8条通路和58种代谢物与多种癌症相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::53f2d8130fcc6defac99679b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"反向MR分析，P_IVW < 0.05\",\n          \"finding\": \"发现结直肠癌与Syntrophorhabdia之间存在名义上的双向因果关系；肺癌与硫酸盐还原通路、甲状腺癌与卟啉生物合成通路也存在潜在双向关系；26种血浆代谢物与癌症存在双向因果关联。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ac2510c5b5936aa4af9cc930\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"MVMR和中介分析，P < 0.05\",\n          \"finding\": \"确认了9条显著的中介通路。例如，Gordonibacter丰度通过调节Palmitoleate (16:1n7)水平介导了15.60%的食管癌保护作用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::48cca68e27b116e9f350b0ac\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eae7452630896bd2e34e5212\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"1. 肠道微生物群的改变是癌症发病的因果驱动因素还是继发性后果？2. 微生物群失调与癌症风险之间是否存在双向因果关系？3. 血浆代谢物在微生物-癌症相互作用中发挥多大程度的介导作用？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::26f95f0b97bc5ed89346f58e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究欧洲人群（GWAS数据）中肠道微生物群（473种菌属/种、205条代谢通路）、血浆代谢物（1091种代谢物及309种比值）与8种泛癌（乳腺癌、结直肠癌、子宫内膜癌、食管癌、卵巢癌、肺癌、前列腺癌、甲状腺癌）之间的因果关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::72c3469b1383e11cd71c06c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在解决肠道微生物群改变是癌症病因还是继发后果的争议，以及两者间的双向因果和代谢介导机制尚不明确的问题。作者利用两样本双向孟德尔随机化（MR）分析，结合多变量MR（MVMR）和中介效应分析，系统评估了肠道微生物、血浆代谢物与泛癌风险之间的潜在因果联系。研究通过筛选遗传工具变量，排除了异质性和水平多效性干扰，识别出具有稳健因果关联的微生物、代谢物和通路，并量化了代谢物在微生物-癌症轴中的中介比例。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3a7b4f528c7f9b50a18a2cfd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些中介效应是基于遗传关联推断的，并非直接的实验验证机制。中介比例通常较小，且多数关联仅在名义显著水平，需谨慎解读其临床解释力。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物通过调节特定血浆代谢物（如棕榈油酸、丙酰肉碱等）进而影响癌症风险的因果证据链。具体指出了9条中介通路，例如Gordonibacter通过Palmitoleate影响食管癌。这有助于解释微生物如何不直接作用于肿瘤细胞，而是通过系统性代谢重编程来介导其对宿主的影响。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::81b663c0ae20f274dc44b366\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"研究关注的是癌症发病风险（etiology），而非现有癌症患者接受ICI治疗后的疗效（efficacy/response）。因此，不能直接推断这些微生物对ICI疗效的影响方向或程度。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"识别了与多种实体瘤（包括肺癌、乳腺癌、结直肠癌等ICI主要适应症）有因果关联的特定微生物属（如Ruminococcus D bicirculans, Gluconobacter, Holdemania等）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::de7a4522c66f7ab6f27feff7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究发现8条血浆代谢通路参与多种癌症发展，如氨基酸代谢、嘌呤降解等。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1ccacaa3226821fea88b4ce7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中提到的与肺癌、乳腺癌、结直肠癌等相关的微生物（如Ruminococcus, Fusobacterium等）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5873b17349430789679f464d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"使用MR方法克服观察性研究的混杂和反向因果偏倚。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ad4414ed7af54e1e83783b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究仅涵盖8种癌症，未包含所有实体瘤（如黑色素瘤虽在讨论中被提及作为ICI背景，但未纳入MR分析主体）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d1fb94856315c33c55d973ed\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"结果主要反映癌症发生的遗传易感性，不能直接外推至已确诊癌症患者的治疗反应。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c6e4ff84fd3ce9891a6b9178\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"部分高FDR值的结果应被视为假设生成性质，而非确证性证据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::23ceced867ce2023de5cf4ad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"所有数据源自欧洲人群，不适用于非欧洲裔群体的直接推断。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::08567a32027e1b861f221b6b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0059\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3aeccc2845ceecb2fe0c2c6e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::07cd5b2d6202c7ff598866a1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::03706fac74e9ae78cf0cf089\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e4086809617589731824e1dd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The authors conducted a structured narrative review using an evidence-based approach. They performed an extensive literature search covering peer-reviewed articles, expert reports, book chapters, and conference proceedings published between 1995 and 2025. Keywords included 'microbiome', 'immune checkpoint', 'cancer progression', 'immunotherapy', 'tumour microenvironment', and 'immune regulation'. The material was systematically evaluated and organized into four main sections: 1) Human microbiome and cancer development, 2) Immune checkpoint mechanisms and cancer progression, 3) Challenges of microbiome and immune checkpoint inhibitions, and 4) Innovative immune modulation checkpoints for future strategies. The review relies on summarizing existing theoretical discussions and experimental studies rather than conducting new primary research.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::55a02a2dc52e7580d6d66133\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides a comprehensive overview of the intersection between microbiome science and immune checkpoint biology, categorizing mechanisms by checkpoint type (PD-1, CTLA-4, LAG-3) and microbial influence.\",\n          \"limits\": \"As a narrative review, it does not present new primary data or a systematic meta-analysis. The exact molecular signaling pathways used by microbes to enhance anti-cancer immunity remain unclear according to the authors, indicating a gap in current mechanistic understanding.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::67c4c3e6af96242f4541dbea\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Highlights the therapeutic potential of combining microbiome modulation (probiotics, prebiotics, diet) with ICIs.\",\n          \"limits\": \"The review notes that most research focuses on the gut microbiome, leaving the roles of lung, skin, and tumor microbiomes underexplored. Clinical translation is still in early stages, and standardized models for studying these interactions are lacking.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::95d22bb66d151b71205145ed\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"General mechanism described\",\n          \"finding\": \"Microbiome dysbiosis is associated with increased inflammation, tumor progression, and reduced efficacy of ICIs, while a balanced microbiome promotes favorable immune responses.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5e29304bf98a9b6bf9a119bc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Specific bacterial species mentioned\",\n          \"finding\": \"Bacteria such as Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium, and Faecalibacterium are implicated in promoting T-cell activation and anti-tumor immunity, potentially through the production of short-chain fatty acids (SCFAs) like butyrate and propionate.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a635ddba111bab4d9611550c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Molecular pathway description\",\n          \"finding\": \"PD-1/PD-L1 and CTLA-4 pathways inhibit T-cell activation via SHP-2 recruitment and dephosphorylation of key signaling molecules (ZAP-70, PI3K), leading to T-cell exhaustion. Dual blockade of PD-1 and LAG-3 enhances CD8+ T-cell clonal diversity and IFN-γ production.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::aea122fb269004e049b5e290\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Host factors\",\n          \"finding\": \"Inter-individual differences in HLA heterozygosity and germline mutations (e.g., in TLR genes) significantly influence the response to ICIs and microbiome composition.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3bfbd0dcede79f72a5275257\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a01e8693a7f8797a6b42e997\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review aims to address the complex relationship between the microbiome and immune checkpoint mechanisms in cancer, specifically seeking to understand how microbiome composition impacts immune checkpoint expression/function, the challenges limiting anti-tumoral efficacy, and the innovative prospects for future anti-cancer strategies integrating microbiome science with immunotherapy.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1b4d9c3cfeb80380f15a8c54\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review covers the interaction between the human microbiome (primarily gut, but also lung, skin, and tumor) and immune checkpoint mechanisms (PD-1, PD-L1, CTLA-4, LAG-3, TIM-3) in the context of cancer progression and immunotherapy. It spans from basic molecular mechanisms to clinical implications, including dietary and environmental influences.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::93df419f23881e7bb626802e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This structured narrative review synthesizes current knowledge on how the microbiome modulates immune responses and affects the efficacy of immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) in cancer. The authors outline the biological basis of immune checkpoints, discuss specific microbial species and metabolites that influence T-cell activity, and explore challenges such as inter-individual variability and dysbiosis. The paper highlights the potential of combining microbiome modulation (via probiotics, diet, or FMT) with ICI therapies to overcome resistance and improve patient outcomes, while noting gaps in understanding molecular signaling pathways and the role of non-gut microbiomes.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bafd57110247206857a0e5b8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The review summarizes associations and potential mechanisms but does not provide specific clinical trial data or hazard ratios for these bacteria in solid tumors. It acknowledges that the exact molecular pathways are understudied.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Identifies specific microbial taxa (Akkermansia, Bifidobacterium, Faecalibacterium) associated with improved ICI efficacy and explains their general role in promoting anti-tumor immunity through T-cell modulation and SCFA production.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b6347179d994b6c43aa5ab53\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The connection between specific microbial metabolites and these precise intracellular signaling cascades is stated as 'understudied' and 'unclear' in the text. The review links them conceptually but does not detail the direct causal chain for every bacterium-metabolite-target interaction.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Details the molecular mechanisms of immune checkpoints (PD-1/CTLA-4 signaling via SHP-2, ZAP-70, PI3K/AKT/mTOR) and how they lead to T-cell exhaustion. Also describes how dual blockade (PD-1/LAG-3) can reverse some of these effects by enhancing clonal diversity and IFN-γ production.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8315483e27ca8a91fa594278\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"These are presented as general factors influencing variability; specific interactions between particular microbial strains and specific HLA alleles are not detailed.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Discusses host factors such as HLA heterozygosity and germline mutations (TLR, CTLA-4, PD-1 SNPs) that influence both microbiome composition and ICI response.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::06d348d8542dae49e25ecd4d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Descriptions of PD-1, CTLA-4, LAG-3, and TIM-3 functions, their role in T-cell regulation, and the concept of immune evasion.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2303aa38abbbb294e5728f90\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Mentions of high-fiber/Mediterranean diets promoting beneficial bacteria, and ultra-processed foods/dysbiosis linked to poor outcomes.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::15d644fbea992ad437f01b6f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Explicit statements that the exact molecular signaling pathways of microbes are unclear, and that non-gut microbiomes (lung, skin, tumor) are underexplored.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9b8a1900c0acca7bd3801284\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This is a narrative review, not a systematic meta-analysis; findings represent synthesized perspectives rather than pooled statistical results.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::aa63729cb0ce9c470294b016\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review explicitly states that the exact molecular mechanisms by which microbes influence specific checkpoints are 'understudied' and 'unclear'; do not infer direct causal chains where only associative or hypothetical links are made.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5e556766daf1ba1ff970208b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"While gut microbiome is the primary focus, the review acknowledges significant gaps in knowledge regarding lung, skin, and tumor microbiomes; avoid assuming gut findings apply universally to all tissue sites without caution.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8d689bcd3159587560683629\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Claims about specific bacteria (e.g., Akkermansia) improving ICI efficacy are based on emerging evidence summarized here; verify against primary clinical trials for specific solid tumor types if precise efficacy metrics are required.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::148441cdf053ea845666e0f4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0005\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a96686bee2f7be7a8dd8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-724817b1ad2fa81c8182\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::2e9439305eb09bc0d83eda6d\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c63d5fbb47ffa46172f25167\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::360f4d715a1e85a344fd0e8a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::54460fcc9b674b16fa00b8fb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用回顾性队列分析方法。首先从2021年《Science》发表的“饮食纤维和益生菌影响黑色素瘤免疫治疗反应”研究中提取AYA队列（N=23）。随后进行倾向评分或匹配设计，按2:1比例选取50-70岁的老年非AYA患者作为对照组。统计控制变量包括性别、BMI、种族、治疗初治状态、疾病分期（III期/IV期）、吸烟、药物及酒精使用史。利用高通量测序数据进行Alpha和Beta多样性分析，并进行差异丰度分析（Differential Analysis）以识别组间特异性微生物标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a79c95afeb0ce7aea3853d69\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"首次系统性地描述了AYA黑色素瘤患者肠道微生物组的特征，并明确了其与老年患者的关键差异（如Bacteroides stercoris vs Ruminococcaceae/Blautia/Dorea的分布）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（AYA仅23人）；数据来源于二手提取而非独立前瞻性收集；未直接报告微生物组特征与ICI具体临床疗效（如ORR, PFS, OS）的相关性，仅提供了基线特征描述；部分P值报告可能存在格式错误（如Blautia obeum的p值缺失或异常），需谨慎解读统计显著性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c24ca101fe6ac33803d551a3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"AYA (15-39岁) vs. Older non-AYA (50-70岁)，匹配后样本量分别为23和46\",\n          \"finding\": \"Alpha和Beta多样性在两组间无统计学显著差异；但观察到Alpha多样性随年龄增加而增加的趋势。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a7ce9a312d9ed2f1638e875e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"差异丰度分析\",\n          \"finding\": \"老年非AYA患者中Ruminococcaceae科（家族水平）丰度显著更高；AYA患者中Bacteroides stercoris丰度更高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::597957f0559b74ad71d261ab\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"特定菌种 prevalence\",\n          \"finding\": \"Blautia massiliensia (p=0.010), Blautia obeum, 和 Dorea longicatena (p=0.035) 在老年非AYA患者中显著更常见，这些物种已知与肥胖生物标志物相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::95adf190e53a839c4f66cc2f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4b42c6910a5ab5e3934dd15b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）已改变晚期黑色素瘤的治疗格局，但青少年及年轻成人（AYA）群体在此类治疗中的生存获益历史上低于其他年龄段，且关于该特定人群肠道微生物组对ICI疗效影响的研究匮乏。本研究试图明确AYA患者肠道微生物组的独特特征，以解释潜在的疗效差异并为个性化治疗提供依据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5ab529a33fc4aa7c0ba1ad7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为15-39岁的青少年及年轻成人（AYA）黑色素瘤患者，以及50-70岁的老年非AYA患者。研究情境为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期黑色素瘤患者。数据来源为2021年《Science》发表的一项研究的回顾性队列数据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::621c238c42151ca1082b6986\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在比较AYA与老年黑色素瘤患者在接受免疫检查点抑制剂治疗前的肠道微生物组特征差异。研究从既往大型研究中提取了23名AYA患者，并按2:1比例匹配了46名老年患者作为对照。在控制了性别、BMI、种族、疾病分期等混杂因素后，通过测序数据分析两组间的微生物多样性及特定菌属丰度。研究发现两组间整体多样性无显著差异，但物种组成存在显著不同：老年组中富集了随年龄增长而增加的Ruminococcaceae科及与肥胖相关的Blautia和Dorea属细菌，而AYA组中Bacteroides stercoris丰度较高。结论指出AYA与老年患者的肠道菌群特征存在本质差异，提示针对AYA人群的微生物调节策略需区别于老年人。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b90473264289de79142d0882\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅描述基线特征，未直接关联临床结局（如生存期或缓解率）。不能直接证明这些菌群差异导致了疗效差异，只能说明存在相关性或潜在风险因素。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了AYA与老年黑色素瘤患者肠道菌群组成的基线差异数据。具体显示AYA患者富含Bacteroides stercoris，而老年患者富含Ruminococcaceae及Blautia/Dorea属。这有助于解释不同年龄组患者微环境的基础差异，进而可能影响ICI疗效。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::91f62d029f6d062893eab747\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制推断较弱。虽然提到B. stercoris与纤维摄入相关，但未在本文中进行因果验证。不能据此断定菌群差异是疗效差异的唯一机制。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"指出了AYA与老年患者菌群结构的显著不同，特别是涉及膳食纤维代谢相关菌种（Bacteroides stercoris与纤维摄入正相关）的差异。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3c26278e9a3f998a24452ba0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"AYA患者（15-39岁）在黑色素瘤流行病学和治疗反应上的独特性，以及当前研究在该群体的缺乏。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fdb042fcd8544ecc1908f039\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"发现AYA患者中Bacteroides stercoris较多，而老年患者中肥胖相关菌（Blautia/Dorea）较多。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::26808b690a8af30833a15b67\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为横断面基线描述，未建立菌群与临床结局的直接因果联系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fff1a9c3ac39dbe1c9eda1d9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量小（N=23），统计效力有限，尤其是亚组分析结果需谨慎对待。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b18352633f474ecd4cf79305\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"数据源自2021年《Science》论文的二次提取，原始研究的详细方法学细节（如测序深度、生信流程）在本摘要中未完全交代，需查阅原文确认。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::023c913f5bd9899f87bdf664\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"P值报告存在不一致（如Blautia obeum的p值），阅读时需保持警惕，不宜过度强调统计显著性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d04\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a1545368d30cd49932a56c4e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0010\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"pdf\",\n              \"reason\": \"full-page text extracted; page 